  "separationOfDuties": {
    "note": "recommendation:approve gates POST /api/v1/decisions (creating a Decision — approve/modify/reject/defer a Recommendation). It is granted to DISTRICT_OFFICER (the operational approver role) and to SUPER_ADMIN (which has every permission by definition, including break-glass override), and explicitly withheld from every other role — most importantly STATE_ADMIN, which has broad read/write but is structurally barred from being the approver of the recommendations its own state's data feeds into.",
